Abstract = {This research investigates the process and matters concern in planning
   for open space in urban residential area. In Malaysia, for developing a
   residential neighbourhood, urban planner will prepare a layout plan that
   applies government policies. However, the roles of a landscape architect
   only take places once the layout approved which has resulted to
   inappropriate zoning for open space in neighbourhood area. Hence, the
