Abstract = {Social sustainability can be attributed to various physical factors in
   the city. Among the important factors that are often associated with
   social sustainability is the availability of public spaces. However the
   success of this public space is still disputable. This study is about
   the urban plaza and its role in the formation of a sustainable and
   vibrant city. It asserts that the existence and preservation of such
   spaces in a city is vital. The findings from the study highlights that
   urban plaza has more than one meaning, strong reason that encourages the
   locals to utilize the area. (C) 2014 The Authors. Published by Elsevier
