   their vary in abilities, age, and gender. Universal Design is a design
   which facilitated full range of human diversity. Old city is an area of
   conservation in Semarang which having open space for communal
   activities. The purpose of this study is to examine the old city open
   space (Taman Srigunting and Polder Tawang cases based universal design
   principles for giving proper directions to develop better urban
