   access and linkage (GAL), degree of comfort and image (DCI), user and
   activities (UAC) and sociability (SOC). Six public park in Malaysia
   involved in this study conducted through a survey using a questionnaire.
   The validation and reliability of four constructs were done using
   Cronbach's Alpha. The result found that all construct achieved
   Cronbach's Alpha coefficient level exceeding 0.60 (GAL= 0.89, DCI= 0.82,
   UAC= 0.82, SOC= 0.82). These results explain all items in GAL, DCI, UAC
