   always subjective. The best assessor of the established product is the
   resident himself. A scientific study completed by the authors was an
   attempt to find a way to determinate the efficiency of urban handling
   and reconstructions. A hypothesis formed on the existence of reliable
   statistical the quality of individual cities' handling and maintenance,
