   interactive relationship between urban development and ecological
   environment. In this paper, it described urbanization, urban ecological
   environment and the relationship between the two and also analysed the
   pressure from sustainable urban development. Moreover, how it approached
   the coordinated development of ecological environment and urban
   development. Considered that we should fundamentally prevent new
   environmental problems caused by the process of urban development and at
