Note = {5th International Conference on Renewable Energy and Environmental
   Protection (ICREEP), ELECTR NETWORK, OCT 23-25, 2020},
Abstract = {Under the background of rapid urbanization, a series of problems have
   arisen in some areas, such as the shortage of land resources, the
   backwardness of landscape construction and the decline of urban
   vitality. As the basic water conservancy facilities of the city, the
   transformation of the urban canal can effectively promote the intensive
   use of urban land and urban ecological environment, and improve the
   vitality of urban public space. This paper first summarizes the main
   theories and practices of landscape urbanism through literature review,
   and emphasizes the importance of ``landscape infrastructure{''} in the
   strategic level. Finally, the strategies and methods of Landscape
   Urbanism in urban canal renewal are discussed based on the case of open
   channel renewal.},
