Organization = {Sustainable Dev City Grp; Cent S Univ, Hunan Inst Syst Engn \&
   Management},
Abstract = {Urban ecological environment as a key measure of an urban sustainable
   development level is an important basis for the formation and
   development of the city. The research on urban ecological environment
   has become more and more popular in big cities. Under the goal of
   establishing national environmental protected exemplary city of China,
   the development state of ecological environment of Yinchuan has been
   obviously improved. In this paper it was analyzed and researched on
   climate, air quality, water situation, Regional socio-economic,
   hydrology, soil condition, urban green, regional socio-economic, urban
   tour of Yinchuan during 2004-2008, which founded that there were still
   some deficiencies, Such as industrial structural pollution, low
   efficient utilization in water resources and urban monitoring system.
   According to these problems, there were some suggestions for them. How
   to improve the ecological environment of Yinchuan, the key is that it
   should develop efficient urban, save water scientific, and improve
   environmental supervision and management.},
