   cosy, relaxed, more aesthetic and convenient living conditions. However
   there is a trend that more and more of the people are concentrated in
   urban areas. Here they can find a better social prospects and more
   comfortable lifestyle. Therefore urban environmental quality becomes
   more important inevitably. It is influenced strongly not only ecological
   but also social phenomena. There is analyzed the public green spaces in
   Siauliai city. Qualitative and quantitative assessment of green areas in
