Organization = {Int Assoc Appl Sci \& Engn; Natl Cheng Kung Univ},
Abstract = {Taking three indicators, including water environmental pressure, water
   environmental quality and water environmental protection capacity as the
   criterion layers, 20 indicators were selected to establish index system
   of urban residential water environment. Based on this, by combining the
   advantages of unascertained measure theory and the advantages of set
   pair analysis model, the unascertained measure set pair analysis model
   was established. Then the model was built to evaluate the urban
   residential water environment of Shanghai from the view of space-time.
   The results showed that the urban residential water environment of
   Shanghai was in ``unhealthy{''} state, all three criterion layers need
   to be improved. The evaluation result of this method is reasonable and
   has reference value to water resources protection planning, which
   provides a new idea for urban residential water environment evaluation.},
