Abstract = {The water environment of our country's urban lakes and rivers are
   getting worse and worse day by day. So it is imminent to evaluate the
   water environment to find the problems in order to improve and
   strengthen the water protection. In reference to the existing research
   results from home and abroad and having the objective knowledge of the
   water environment problems, this article has established the evaluation
   index system and the evaluation standard of water ecosystem of urban
   rivers and lakes. According to the historical data and monitoring data
   of rivers and lakes in the city, the article has also carried out the
   empirical analysis on the status quo of water ecological environment.
